  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHp/938",
  "contentHtml": "<p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">중학교는 자기장용 전원장치가 없는 경우도 있지요</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">? </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">그럴 경우 건전지를 사용하게 되는데요</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">전자기 실험에 공통으로 적용할 만한 팁을 소개하고자 합니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">1. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">저항을 줄이기 위해 가급적 짧은 전선을 최소 개수로 연결한다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">.</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">2. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">스위치를 연결하였는데 결과가 나오지 않으면 스위치를 제외한다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">.(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">집게 전선 하나가 스위치 역할을 하도록</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">필요할 때만 접촉하여 사용</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">)</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a21e32a8d0264e6de956797fd8ed4204b7526c77\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a21e32a8d0264e6de956797fd8ed4204b7526c77\" data-origin-width=\"1411\" data-origin-height=\"1058\"></div><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv4b0lwbjlayubr1y3qazox5m@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rv4b0lwbjlayubr1y3qazox5m/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33273168827&amp;signature=lIqPgTRPA08nNhEUK%2FQJscsAcUM%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv4b0lwbjlayubr1y3qazox5m?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2NGIwbHdiamxheXVicjF5M3Fhem94NW0iLCJ0aWQiOiJkNzkyY2NlNi0xZjg0LTQwOGQtOWVkMy0wMDEwNDE1MzA3YWEiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODIyOTB9.QVYelItB3rxh2ZnXr8OJlvCk3FPAjGdSUEgq7tb46yFzrWnB4WXoZ89-62AUccGmoqaB4VQ0zA4IMZkZ46L72A&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">3. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">도선 주위에 나침반을 여러 개 놓지 말고 나침반 하나만 사용한다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. (</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">나침반의 위치를 옮겨가며 자침의 변화를 확인</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">)</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">4. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">코일을 사용하였는데 자침의 변화가 없으면 솔레노이드로 대체한다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/55192d6f4b8d98412e36257094fa4297f3814387\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/55192d6f4b8d98412e36257094fa4297f3814387\" data-origin-width=\"916\" data-origin-height=\"583\"></div><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvgv2859e41024isuiv10v011@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvgv2859e41024isuiv10v011/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33273168885&amp;signature=kDrLJnk051SQbNygmmKbXaS2aUA%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvgv2859e41024isuiv10v011?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2Z3YyODU5ZTQxMDI0aXN1aXYxMHYwMTEiLCJ0aWQiOiIxMTY5NmM4OC1jMDhhLTQwNjAtYTYzOC1lMTczYjFkYzM1NGYiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODIyOTB9.fVx7CKlfytDa4qu9-q2HnJVhq78reMUzxcHQ9-N1_bZ5UczuCPiYRyb_04U-OqXnyaZrWXcfKXxTIvuRiIzX1g&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">5. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">자기장에서 전류가 흐르는 도선이 받는 힘 관찰하기 실험은 알루미늄 포일을 활용해도 결과가 잘 나온다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. 그리고 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">전선 그네는 움직임이 확실하므로 힘의 방향 찾기 익힐 때</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">플레밍의 왼손 법칙</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, F B I) </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">학생들이 이해하기 쉽다는 반응을 보인다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b34284b9773245f731260ac4c27abad50a2da240\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b34284b9773245f731260ac4c27abad50a2da240\" data-origin-width=\"320\" data-origin-height=\"166\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f03bed7a321fb6a90427c96030fa5ca85c1fd0a5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f03bed7a321fb6a90427c96030fa5ca85c1fd0a5\" data-origin-width=\"1411\" data-origin-height=\"1058\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9ee0e5409fcb56f52fbb1952a085a3da2e035384\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9ee0e5409fcb56f52fbb1952a085a3da2e035384\" data-origin-width=\"1411\" data-origin-height=\"1058\"></div><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvt9wuaypz9q95styictnwd1b@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvt9wuaypz9q95styictnwd1b/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33273168956&amp;signature=Z0OPJBY5kRenFULlEwxS20YTClk%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvt9wuaypz9q95styictnwd1b?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2dDl3dWF5cHo5cTk1c3R5aWN0bndkMWIiLCJ0aWQiOiJiOTZlNjJhMS1lMGM1LTQwNzctYjc5ZC1iNDI5ODUyNzI4YWQiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODIyOTB9.uiDgzo-7iUi3y1G2OBGMxvgJEfMw3jngW53Va3f9ZL80eCgolpebkVDK_TQrJBmg2yp7mmWgeodKd-Pi4NK05A&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">전동기 만들기는 집게</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">불독 클립</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">크기 중</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">)</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">를 활용한 방법을 선택하였습니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">김정식 선생님의 블로그에 자세히 소개되어 있습니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">연습하는 시간을 가졌는데</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">대충</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(?) </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">만들어도 잘 돌아가네요</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvi7vti6m2xvbcwncchp2v22j@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvi7vti6m2xvbcwncchp2v22j/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33273168989&amp;signature=Jna55cPkXzU8VbOrmq5dDM4Oe3s%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvi7vti6m2xvbcwncchp2v22j?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2aTd2dGk2bTJ4dmJjd25jY2hwMnYyMmoiLCJ0aWQiOiJlMzM1ZmM5YS05MDYxLTRmODQtODliNy02YmQ5OTg4YWQxZjgiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODIyOTB9.iYSB_yxNbiVXeT76xU0XTF0PQUCwzBaZfvPNzSYEe-6sHRqFpi-8MvVO4Wdl6ktIy-WZ8lEXSFR_aExuIPvVCA&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
